Windows icon regeneration (Python 3 + Pillow 12.3.0), from the repository root:

python3 - <<'PYTHON'
from PIL import Image
image = Image.open("assets/icon/icon_1024.png").convert("RGBA")
image.save("assets/icon/icon.ico", format="ICO",
           sizes=[(s, s) for s in (16, 32, 48, 64, 128, 256)])
PYTHON

The ICO contains all six sizes, including the 256 x 256 PNG entry.
